            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
              Chandler's desert environment means constant exposure to fine dust and sand that penetrates deep into carpet fibers. Our Hot Carbonating Extraction process lifts these particles from the base of your carpet, not just the surface.
            </p>
